    insensitive).  Surrounding whitespace, an optional ``0x`` prefix and
    whitespace between digit pairs are tolerated so that the helper works
    with hex dumps as well as plain hex strings.
    """
    if isinstance(compressed_hex, (bytes, bytearray)):
